===Format===
[[File:RLCS Swiss Format.jpg|thumbnail|335px|A graphical explanation of the Swiss System format]]
*'''Wildcard''' - ''August 3rd - 6th, 2023''
** 16 Team Swiss System Format.
***All matches are {{Abbr/Bo7}}.
** <span class="bg-up">Top 8</span> Teams - proceed to the [[Rocket_League_Championship_Series/2022-23#Group Stage|Group Stage]].

*'''Group Stage''' - ''August 8th - 12th, 2023''
**16 teams split into 2 groups of 8.
**Double Elimination Bracket.
***All matches are {{Abbr/Bo7}}.
**<span class="bg-up">Top 4</span> - 8 in total - advances to the [[Rocket League Championship Series/2022-23#Playoffs|Playoffs]].

*'''Playoffs''' - ''August 12th - 13th, 2023''
**Single Elimination Bracket.
***All matches are {{Abbr/Bo7}}.

''Crowd Days: August 11th - 13th''

